    "paragraph": "\"Neighborhood-scale barrier-free accessibility assessment using handheld LiDAR point cloud\" develops a neighborhood-scale barrier-free accessibility assessment framework using handheld LiDAR point clouds. \"Iterative negotiation and oversight: A case study in decentralized air traffic management\" introduces a regulated decentralized negotiation framework that combines asset trading with limited regulatory oversight to help self-interested agents reach consensus without revealing private valuations. \"Improving feasibility in the quantum approximate optimization algorithm for vehicle routing via constraint-aware initialization and hybrid XY–X mixing\" introduces a constraint-aware Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm framework for the vehicle routing problem, featuring an initialization strategy that encodes specific constraints into the initial state and a hybrid XY-X mixer to protect selected solution structures while allowing exploration of others.",
